  "label": "Text falsely claims African American leaders are organizing the riots, mapped onto the chaotic riot scene",
  "description": "The top text overlay 'african american leaders organizing the la riots' is analogically mapped onto the visual material of the chaotic riot scene. The text falsely attributes organization and leadership to African American leaders, while the visual material depicts the actual riots — a spontaneous outburst of protest and violence — thereby creating a false equivalence. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it uses the visual chaos to imply that African American leaders were orchestrating the violence, which is a racist trope that scapegoats Black communities for civil unrest.",
